  "title": "Lemon Studio Michael Lane Edition 2026.11.03.6 \u2014 community fixes",
  "notes": "Complete DAW release for Windows, Linux x64, Apple-silicon Mac and Intel Mac. Categorized community bug reports, collapsible replies, completed-item cleanup, compact grouped menus, corrected Hint Bar and CPU visibility, and a changelog grouped by date. Includes simultaneous audio/MIDI recording, playlist scroll fixes, automatic clip grouping, mixer state preservation, copied inline automation, ARA transport updates and reduced multi-monitor redraw work. Includes current built-in Lemon Wave; personal recorded libraries are excluded. Exact device/vendor playback reports remain open. Linux compiled and packaged without runtime/audio testing. Mac packages ad-hoc signed.\n\nhttps://michaellanemusic.de/lemon-studio/",
